assets.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: production-ready sprite atlas for an original polished 2D side-view casual mining game. One single landscape transparent PNG, aspect 2:1. EXACT 4 equal columns by 2 equal rows, eight square cells. Each cell contains exactly one nearly square rock BLOCK, front orthographic view, no perspective, no UI, no captions. All eight blocks the same size and visual scale, centered in their own grid cells with about 3 percent transparent gutter; clean alpha background, absolutely no grid lines.
Art direction: bright fresh luminous cartoon mobile game illustration, thick clean dark ink contour, gorgeous hand-painted faceted surfaces, saturated teal / lemon yellow / pearl white accents, clean playful highly readable at 48px. Strong white highlights, deep small contact shadows; no muddy brown lighting, no realistic material, no generic low-poly rendering, no overall haze. Blocks have softly chipped irregular corners, nearly fill their square cells, substantial weight.
TOP ROW left to right:
1. warm caramel golden soil block, sandstone patches, terracotta shadows, a few grassy moss flecks;
2. deep petrol BLUE stone block, navy outline, brighter slate blue chips, small cyan mineral flecks;
3. bright PEARL WHITE / pale silver stone block with five chunky BLACK coal stones embedded, each coal nugget has slate highlights and bold dark outline;
4. bright PEARL WHITE / pale silver rock filled with five beautiful large GOLD nuggets, lemon-yellow interiors, orange edge facets, bright white gleams, bold dark outline.
BOTTOM ROW left to right:
5. bright pale silver rock with four big faceted CYAN DIAMOND crystals embedded, turquoise facets, icy white highlights, dark clear ink contour;
6. brilliant warm RED TNT block, clean ivory horizontal paper band centered, exact legible text 'TNT' in dark ink, little fuse at top, cartoon wood slat detail;
7. unbreakable deep NAVY BLACK rock block with dark blue facets and a few slate fracture shapes, clearly darker than block number 2;
8. square-front golden-brown wooden TREASURE CHEST, bright gold bands, golden central lock and gems, saturated amber highlights, outlined and compact.
These are eight functional tile assets, not a poster or mockup. Do not add loose extra props between cells. No characters or scenery. Keep the grid EXACTLY aligned and all tile boundaries distinct. Transparent background.
